**This is a fault that needs a logic analyzer** — probe GPIO5 (CLK) and GPIO1 (MOSI) while the peripheral fires and see whether they actually toggle. That's a 5-minute answer with a $10 analyzer and an unbounded guessing game without one. I'd be wasting your time to keep blind-flashing.

